# Repository root.
#
# Scope of this file: what is not specific to the harness. Anything
# harness-shaped belongs in harness/.gitignore, next to the reasoning for its
# neighbours, and that file states its own rule — ignore by explicit extension,
# never by blanket wildcard under results/.

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor ---
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Agent tooling ---
# .claude/settings.json is shared configuration and tracked when it exists.
# The .local variant is machine-specific.
.claude/settings.local.json
